{
  "slug": "sentiment",
  "title_en": "Understanding the Sentiment Board: Market Fear & Greed Thermometer",
  "excerpt_en": "Aggregate options positioning via Put/Call Ratio—often used as a contrarian gauge at extremes.",
  "body_en": "<!-- ===== OptionsAji 博客片段：情绪榜使用说明 ===== -->\n<style>\n  .aji-guide{--bg:#f5f2f0;--ink:#151617;--gold:#c9a227;--card:#fffdfb;--line:#e7e1d8;--muted:#6f6a63;--soft:#c9c2b6;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;line-height:1.75;font-size:16px;padding:4px}\n  .aji-guide h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2px}\n  .aji-guide h3{font-size:18px;margin:26px 0 8px;font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide p{margin:10px 0}.aji-guide .lead{font-size:17px}\n  .aji-guide .accent{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide .chart-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;margin:22px 0;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(21,22,23,.05)}\n  .aji-guide .chart-note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 14px}\n  .aji-guide canvas{max-width:100%}\n  .aji-guide .analogy{border-left:4px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(201,162,39,.07);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;margin:16px 0}\n  .aji-guide .formula{background:#151617;color:#f5f2f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;overflow-x:auto}\n  .aji-guide .formula b{color:var(--gold)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:14.5px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px}\n  .aji-guide .data-table th{background:var(--ink);color:#f5f2f0;text-align:left;padding:11px 14px;font-weight:600}\n  .aji-guide .data-table td{padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}\n  .aji-guide .data-table tr:nth-child(even) td{background:rgba(201,162,39,.035)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table .col{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}\n  .aji-guide .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px}\n  .aji-guide .tag-core{background:var(--gold);color:#fff}.aji-guide .tag-base{background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink)}\n  .aji-guide .gauge-wrap{max-width:360px;margin:0 auto}\n  .aji-guide .disclaimer{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:26px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n  .aji-guide .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(201,162,39,.3);transition:background .15s}\n  .aji-guide .cta:hover{background:#b8911f}\n  .aji-guide .cta-row{margin:16px 0 4px}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom{background:rgba(201,162,39,.08);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;margin:24px 0 8px;text-align:center}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom p{margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aji-guide\">\n  <h2>Understanding the Sentiment Board: Market Fear &amp; Greed Thermometer</h2>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Not a single-contract board—it aggregates <span class=\"accent\">market-wide options positioning</span>. Core metric: <b>Put/Call Ratio (PCR)</b>—fear (puts) vs greed (calls). Often read as a <b>contrarian</b> tool at extremes.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-row\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/sentiment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 Open live Sentiment board →</a></div>\n  <h3>1. What Is Put/Call Ratio (PCR)?</h3>\n  <div class=\"analogy\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><b>PCR = Put activity ÷ Call activity</b> (volume or OI).</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:4px 0\">• PCR <b>&gt;1</b>: puts dominate → <b>fear</b>; extremes often <span class=\"accent\">contrarian bullish</span>.<br>• PCR <b>&lt;0.7</b>: calls dominate → <b>greed</b>; extremes warn of tops.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"formula\">Volume PCR = Put volume / Call volume (fast, noisy)<br>OI PCR = Put OI / Call OI (slower, structural)<br>Guide: &lt;0.7 greed ｜ 0.7–1.0 neutral ｜ &gt;1.0 fear</div>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">PCR Over Time: Swinging Between Fear and Greed (example)</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Dashed = 1.0. Extremes often precede reversals. Rendered with Chart.js via jsDelivr CDN only.</p><canvas id=\"stPcr\" width=\"640\" height=\"300\" aria-label=\"PCR trend\"></canvas></div>\n  <h3>2. Sentiment Index: One Glance</h3>\n  <p>Combines PCR, breadth, vol into a <span class=\"accent\">0–100 index</span>: 0 = extreme fear, 100 = extreme greed. Doesn't predict direction—flags when emotion is stretched.</p>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">Sentiment Index (example: 35 = fear-leaning)</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Semicircle gauge: fear left, greed right. Illustrative.</p><div class=\"gauge-wrap\"><canvas id=\"stGauge\" width=\"360\" height=\"210\" aria-label=\"Sentiment gauge\"></canvas></div></div>\n  <h3>3. Key Metrics</h3>\n  <table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Meaning</th><th>How to use</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Volume PCR <span class=\"tag tag-core\">Core</span></td><td>Today's Put/Call volume ratio.</td><td>Intraday mood; noisy.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">OI PCR <span class=\"tag tag-core\">Core</span></td><td>Put/Call open interest ratio.</td><td>Structural stance.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Sentiment Index</td><td>0–100 composite.</td><td><span class=\"accent\">Extremes (&lt;20 or &gt;80) watch for reversal</span>.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Breadth</td><td>Advancers vs decliners.</td><td>Market-wide participation.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">VIX <span class=\"tag tag-base\">Aux</span></td><td>Volatility index.</td><td>Spikes = risk-off.</td></tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n  <h3>4. Three Reminders</h3>\n  <p><b>1. Sentiment is contrarian context, not timing.</b><br><b>2. Index PCR ≠ single-stock PCR</b> (hedging skews indices).<br><b>3. Combine with price and trend.</b> One number isn't a trade.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-bottom\"><p>Ready to explore? See today's live data 👇</p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/sentiment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 Open live Sentiment board →</a></div><p class=\"disclaimer\">Data may be delayed ~15 minutes. For research only—not investment advice. Options trading involves substantial risk of loss. © OptionsAji</p>\n\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  if(typeof Chart==='undefined')return;\n  var GOLD='#c9a227',GRAY='#c9c2b6',INK='#151617';\n  var days=['Mon','Tue','Wed','Thu','Fri','Mon+1','Tue+1','Wed+1'];\n  var pcr=[0.82,0.95,1.12,1.28,1.05,0.88,0.72,0.68];\n  var c1=document.getElementById('stPcr');\n  if(c1){new Chart(c1,{data:{labels:days,datasets:[\n      {type:'line',label:'Put/Call ratio',data:pcr,borderColor:GOLD,backgroundColor:'rgba(201,162,39,.12)',fill:true,tension:.3,pointRadius:3},\n      {type:'line',label:'Neutral 1.0',data:days.map(function(){return 1;}),borderColor:INK,borderDash:[6,5],borderWidth:1.5,pointRadius:0}]},\n    options:{responsive:true,plugins:{legend:{labels:{color:INK,font:{size:13}}},tooltip:{callbacks:{label:function(i){return i.dataset.type&&i.dataset.borderDash?'':'PCR '+i.parsed.y+(i.parsed.y>1?' (fear)':i.parsed.y<0.7?' (greed)':' (neutral)');}}}},\n    scales:{x:{ticks:{color:INK},grid:{display:false}},y:{ticks:{color:INK},grid:{color:'rgba(21,22,23,.06)'}}}}});}\n\n  // 半环情绪仪表（35）\n  var reading=35;\n  var centerText={id:'ctxt',afterDraw:function(chart){\n    var ctx=chart.ctx,x=chart.getDatasetMeta(0).data[0]?chart.chartArea.left+(chart.chartArea.right-chart.chartArea.left)/2:0;\n    var cy=chart.chartArea.bottom;\n    ctx.save();ctx.textAlign='center';\n    ctx.fillStyle=GOLD;ctx.font='700 34px -apple-system,sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillText(reading,x,cy-6);\n    ctx.fillStyle='#6f6a63';ctx.font='13px -apple-system,sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillText('Fear-leaning',x,cy+14);\n    ctx.restore();\n  }};\n  var g=document.getElementById('stGauge');\n  if(g){new Chart(g,{type:'doughnut',data:{labels:['Current','Remainder'],datasets:[{data:[reading,100-reading],backgroundColor:[GOLD,GRAY],borderWidth:0}]},\n    options:{rotation:-90,circumference:180,cutout:'70%',responsive:true,plugins:{legend:{display:false},tooltip:{enabled:false}}},plugins:[centerText]});}\n})();\n</script>\n<!-- ===== /片段结束 ===== -->"
}
